# NOTE: do NOT add `*.md` back here.
#
# Every visual template in pbi-skills/ is identified by its own SKILL.md —
# lib/skills.py skips any folder that doesn't have one. Excluding *.md
# therefore stripped SKILL.md from the deployment and left the skill registry
# EMPTY in production: the templates still shipped, but nothing could find
# them, so every visual that named a skill silently fell back to a plain
# generic chart. Local and CLI builds read from disk and were unaffected,
# which is why no test caught it.
#
# See tests/test_deployment_packaging.py, which reproduces the deployed file
# set from this exact file and fails if the skill registry comes back empty.
